                    },
                    "message": "On a tangent from some other efforts I've now tested this, after making a small patch to `requester/mctp_endpoint_discovery.cpp` so that `MctpDiscovery::searchConfigurationFor()` doesn't require a `configured_by` association be present.\n\nIt appears to work fine."
